<div data-cgap-sector="Metalworking, Foundries &amp; Fabrication" data-cgap-term="metal shop"></div><p class="lead">Fab shops and foundries have some of the most specific hazards in industry: the point of operation on a press brake, an enclosed laser cutter, plasma table fumes, a squaring shear, and molten metal at the ladle and furnace.</p><p>Every sign here is written for one of those machines or tasks, including press brakes, laser and plasma cutting, shears, robotic weld cells, induction furnaces, ladles and crucible tools, and powder handling. They bolt straight to a machine guard or column.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Molten metal ladle and crucible tools</h3><p>55 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the frame of the ladle preheat stand at eye level on the operator side.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ladle-preheat-stand-sign-cgap-c01016-812">Ladle Preheat Stand</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ladle-shank-handles-sign-cgap-c01151-812">Ladle Shank Handles</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ladle-storage-rack-sign-cgap-c01286-812">Ladle Storage Rack</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-crucible-cooling-stand-sign-cgap-c01421-812">Crucible Cooling Stand</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Press brake</h3><p>40 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the front guard near the back gauge.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-press-brake-back-gauge-sign-cgap-c20531-812">Press Brake Back Gauge</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-press-brake-tonnage-limit-sign-cgap-n19601-812">Press Brake Tonnage Limit</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-press-brake-sign-cgap-i19516-812">Press Brake</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-press-brake-foot-pedal-cable-sign-cgap-c20646-812">Press Brake Foot Pedal Cable</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Laser cutting machine</h3><p>36 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the frame beside the pallet changer shuttle rails.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-laser-pallet-changer-rails-sign-cgap-c10241-812">Laser Pallet Changer Rails</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-laser-cutting-machine-sign-cgap-i11656-812">Laser Cutting Machine</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-laser-cut-parts-edges-sign-cgap-c10376-812">Laser Cut Parts Edges</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-laser-sheet-skeleton-sign-cgap-c10511-812">Laser Sheet Skeleton</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Plasma cutting table</h3><p>29 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the side frame of the water table.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-plasma-water-table-edge-sign-cgap-c16149-812">Plasma Water Table Edge</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-plasma-cutting-table-sign-cgap-i16412-812">Plasma Cutting Table</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-plasma-table-slats-sign-cgap-c16282-812">Plasma Table Slats</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-plasma-torch-consumables-sign-cgap-c16415-812">Plasma Torch Consumables</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Induction furnace</h3><p>10 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the power supply room door frame at floor level, where workers approach the induction furnace.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-furnace-power-supply-room-door-sign-cgap-c01017-812">Furnace Power Supply Room Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-furnace-cooling-water-manifold-sign-cgap-c01152-812">Furnace Cooling Water Manifold</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-furnace-coil-water-hoses-sign-cgap-c01287-812">Furnace Coil Water Hoses</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-furnace-platform-stairs-sign-cgap-c02027-812">Furnace Platform Stairs</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Cnc Pattern Router</h3><p>6 signs written for this equipment.</p><ul><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cnc-pattern-router-sign-cgap-w15139-812">Cnc Pattern Router</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cnc-pattern-router-sign-cgap-w15140-812">Cnc Pattern Router</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cnc-pattern-router-sign-cgap-w15141-812">Cnc Pattern Router</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cnc-pattern-router-sign-cgap-w15142-812">Cnc Pattern Router</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pattern Shop Bandsaw</h3><p>6 signs written for this equipment.</p><ul><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pattern-shop-bandsaw-sign-cgap-w15145-812">Pattern Shop Bandsaw</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pattern-shop-bandsaw-sign-cgap-w15146-812">Pattern Shop Bandsaw</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pattern-shop-bandsaw-sign-cgap-w15147-812">Pattern Shop Bandsaw</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pattern-shop-bandsaw-sign-cgap-w15148-812">Pattern Shop Bandsaw</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Billet Shear</h3><p>6 signs written for this equipment.</p><ul><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-billet-shear-sign-cgap-w15151-812">Billet Shear</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-billet-shear-sign-cgap-w15152-812">Billet Shear</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-billet-shear-sign-cgap-w15153-812">Billet Shear</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-billet-shear-sign-cgap-w15154-812">Billet Shear</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Do you have press brake and shear signs?</summary><p>Yes, including tandem press brakes and hydraulic squaring shears. Search the machine name.</p></details><details><summary>Are there foundry signs for molten metal?</summary><p>Yes, for ladles, crucible tools, induction furnaces and pouring areas. Search &quot;molten metal&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Can these mount directly on machines?</summary><p>Yes. The pre-drilled corners fit standard hardware for guards, panels and columns.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have press brake and shear signs?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including tandem press brakes and hydraulic squaring shears. Search the machine name."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are there foundry signs for molten metal?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, for ladles, crucible tools, induction furnaces and pouring areas. Search \"molten metal\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can these mount directly on machines?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The pre-drilled corners fit standard hardware for guards, panels and columns."}}]}</script>